# Call graph refresh

If this prompt added, changed, renamed, or deleted any file under `backend/app`, `scripts`, or `frontend/src` (not the generated JSON itself):

1. After tests pass, from `backend/` run: `python -m app.callgraph`
2. That rewrites `frontend/public/callgraph/*.json` (relative paths only).
3. Do this at the **end** of the prompt, before the `docs/codex_log.md` entry.
4. Do not hand-edit those JSON files.

Skip if no scanned source files changed.

Do not treat `frontend/public/callgraph/` as source; it is generated output.
